  {
   "title": "Party & GUest List",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>In a true collaboration between talent, agency, and brand this one-of-a-kind party featured the magic and spectacle of a fully immersive Flaming Lips live show. Celebrity attendees included Miley Cyrus, Liam Hemsworth, Elijah Wood, Moby, Shepard Fairey, and many more along with a DJ sets from Pennywild and the Flaming Lips themselves.</p>"
